# Keeps `docker build`'s context small and avoids copying already-built, host-specific artifacts
# into the image - this repo's own .gitignore excludes them from git the same way, but a checkout
# that has already run `dotnet build`/`dotnet test` locally (any of the Dockerfiles under docker/
# COPY the whole repository in) still has them on disk. .git stays included - Nerdbank.
# GitVersioning needs it to compute the version height during `dotnet publish`/`dotnet pack`.
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/TestResults/
packages/
